# The repository root .gitignore ignores every `data/` directory. The frozen
# split source vpd/walkerbench/data/split_city.json (sha256 41f9635a..., see
# PREREG_WB_PILOT.md section 2.2) must be committed, so re-include that one dir.
!/walkerbench/data/
# Never commit bytecode from test runs.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
